cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TensorCanvas in your research or teaching, please cite it."
title: "TensorCanvas: A Visual Neural-Network Exploration & Intervention Studio"
abstract: >-
  TensorCanvas is an open-source studio for building neural networks visually,
  running inference, inspecting activations layer by layer, and intervening on
  weights to see how behaviour changes — in the browser, backed by PyTorch.
type: software
